      <title>智界V9八月交付8312台 赵长江称高端MPV消费回归产品价值</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E6%99%BA%E7%95%8CV9%E5%85%AB%E6%9C%88%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%988312%E5%8F%B0-%E8%B5%B5%E9%95%BF%E6%B1%9F%E7%A7%B0%E9%AB%98%E7%AB%AFMPV%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E5%9B%9E%E5%BD%92%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC/</link>
